1
00:00:00,508 --> 00:00:03,448
Why Your Leaders Aren't the Problem.

2
00:00:03,488 --> 00:00:05,448
With over two billion humans suffering from

3
00:00:05,448 --> 00:00:07,448
disease, you'd have to be a complete

4
00:00:07,448 --> 00:00:10,048
psychopath to make the conscious decision to

5
00:00:10,048 --> 00:00:12,368
spend six hundred and four times more

6
00:00:12,368 --> 00:00:15,348
on weapons than on helping them.

7
00:00:15,348 --> 00:00:17,348
But your leaders aren't monsters.

8
00:00:17,448 --> 00:00:18,728
They're just operating in a system

9
00:00:18,728 --> 00:00:21,208
that rewards the wrong things.

10
00:00:21,208 --> 00:00:23,048
Your civilization's incentive structure

11
00:00:23,048 --> 00:00:25,228
is the psychopath: Weapons

12
00:00:25,228 --> 00:00:28,508
manufacturers give politicians papers.

13
00:00:28,508 --> 00:00:30,828
Politicians use the papers to get

14
00:00:30,828 --> 00:00:32,968
people to vote for them.

15
00:00:32,968 --> 00:00:34,148
Voting for them gives them

16
00:00:34,148 --> 00:00:35,388
the power to give more

17
00:00:35,388 --> 00:00:38,128
papers to weapons manufacturers.

18
00:00:38,128 --> 00:00:39,328
Weapons

19
00:00:39,348 --> 00:00:41,468
manufacturers give them more papers.

20
00:00:41,468 --> 00:00:43,608
It's circular, like a dog chasing

21
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:45,348
its tail, except the dog is

22
00:00:45,348 --> 00:00:47,108
democracy and the tail is made

23
00:00:47,108 --> 00:00:49,468
of money and corpses.

24
00:00:49,928 --> 00:00:51,608
No individual human in

25
00:00:51,608 --> 00:00:53,388
this loop is evil.

26
00:00:53,388 --> 00:00:55,128
The loop is evil.

27
00:00:55,128 --> 00:00:56,548
Every politician in it is

28
00:00:56,548 --> 00:00:59,348
making the locally rational choice:

29
00:00:59,348 --> 00:01:00,828
take the papers or lose your

30
00:01:00,828 --> 00:01:02,708
job to someone who will.

31
00:01:02,708 --> 00:01:04,448
It's a machine that converts

32
00:01:04,448 --> 00:01:06,968
good intentions into missiles, and

33
00:01:06,968 --> 00:01:09,008
it runs automatically.

34
00:01:09,288 --> 00:01:10,928
This loop does not even

35
00:01:10,928 --> 00:01:13,448
benefit the humans inside it.

36
00:01:13,448 --> 00:01:16,168
The weapons manufacturers get diseases.

37
00:01:16,168 --> 00:01:18,148
Their children get diseases.

38
00:01:18,148 --> 00:01:21,108
Everyone they love gets diseases.

39
00:01:21,108 --> 00:01:22,488
They live in the same economy

40
00:01:22,488 --> 00:01:24,708
that the loop is shrinking.

41
00:01:24,708 --> 00:01:26,448
If the loop breaks and the redirect

42
00:01:26,448 --> 00:01:29,148
happens, they lose one percent of their

43
00:01:29,148 --> 00:01:32,168
doomsday-device revenue and gain a one point

44
00:01:32,168 --> 00:01:34,788
four three times larger economy to sell

45
00:01:34,788 --> 00:01:37,588
into, plus the ability to invest in

46
00:01:37,588 --> 00:01:40,428
the biotech sector that absorbs the redirected

47
00:01:40,428 --> 00:01:44,048
twenty-seven point two billion dollars a year,

48
00:01:44,048 --> 00:01:46,348
plus not being dead.

49
00:01:46,668 --> 00:01:47,768
This is not a case

50
00:01:47,768 --> 00:01:50,288
where an entrenched industry rationally

51
00:01:50,288 --> 00:01:52,428
profits at the public's expense.

52
00:01:52,428 --> 00:01:54,348
There is no rational beneficiary

53
00:01:54,348 --> 00:01:56,028
of the current arrangement.

54
00:01:56,028 --> 00:01:58,168
Everyone in the loop is worse off,

55
00:01:58,168 --> 00:01:59,748
including the people running it.

56
00:01:59,748 --> 00:02:01,798
They just haven't done the arithmetic.

57
00:02:01,948 --> 00:02:04,308
There's literally no voting your

58
00:02:04,308 --> 00:02:05,488
way out of this.

59
00:02:05,488 --> 00:02:06,948
It doesn't matter which political

60
00:02:06,948 --> 00:02:08,428
party is in power.

61
00:02:08,428 --> 00:02:10,888
Your "red team" and "blue team"

62
00:02:10,888 --> 00:02:14,068
argue about everything except the loop,

63
00:02:14,068 --> 00:02:15,988
because they're both inside it.

64
00:02:15,988 --> 00:02:17,328
They are all slaves to

65
00:02:17,328 --> 00:02:19,668
the same incentive structure, wearing

66
00:02:19,668 --> 00:02:21,608
different colored ties.

67
00:02:21,608 --> 00:02:23,248
Switching parties is like changing the

68
00:02:23,248 --> 00:02:25,848
wallpaper in a burning building.

69
00:02:26,008 --> 00:02:28,308
This manual doesn't ask politicians

70
00:02:28,308 --> 00:02:30,528
to become better people (that's

71
00:02:30,528 --> 00:02:32,268
clearly out of the question).

72
00:02:32,268 --> 00:02:34,288
It builds a better loop.

73
00:02:34,288 --> 00:02:35,848
You give them MORE papers

74
00:02:35,848 --> 00:02:38,368
to do the OPPOSITE thing.

75
00:02:38,368 --> 00:02:40,948
Same dog, same tail, but now the

76
00:02:40,948 --> 00:02:43,528
tail is made of cured diseases and

77
00:02:43,528 --> 00:02:46,132
the dog gets reelected for chasing it.
